<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>About Us - MEGATERRA</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/base.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/layout.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/components.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/pages/about.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include('../partials/navbar') %>

    <!-- Hero banner -->
    <div class="about-banner">
      <img src="/images/hero-banners/about-hero.webp" alt="About Us Banner" />
    </div>

    <main>
      <section class="about-content-section">
        <div class="about-content-image-container">
          <img src="/images/placeholder-image-1.webp" alt="Test Image" />
        </div>
        <div class="about-content-text-container">
          <p>
            Megaterra is a digital platform developed by PT Megah Nex
            Technology, a technology company committed to delivering innovative
            digital solutions across various industries. As part of a diverse
            business ecosystem, we support and connect businesses in
            transportation, travel, tourism, golf, vehicle rental, and many
            other service sectors through modern and reliable technology.
          </p>
          <br />
          <p>
            Our platform brings together a range of trusted businesses under one
            digital experience, including Majestic Fast Ferry, Batam Centre
            Harbour, Batam Island Country Club, Meyer Rental, and many more. By
            integrating these services, we make it easier for customers to
            access transportation, discover destinations, book activities, and
            enjoy premium lifestyle experiences—all in one place.
          </p>
          <br />
          <p>
            Driven by innovation and a customer-first approach, PT Megah Nex
            Technology continuously develops digital solutions that enhance
            convenience, efficiency, and accessibility. Our mission is to bridge
            technology with exceptional services, creating seamless experiences
            for travelers, businesses, and communities alike.
          </p>
          <br />
          <p>
            Whether you're planning a journey, exploring new destinations,
            booking a golf experience, arranging transportation, or accessing
            other lifestyle services, Megaterra is your trusted gateway to a
            smarter and more connected experience.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="core-values-section">
        <div class="core-values-header">
          <h2>Core Values</h2>
          <p>
            The principles that guide every interaction and every feature we
            build.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bento-grid">
          <!-- Card 1 -->
          <div class="bento-card card-trust">
            <i data-lucide="shield-check"></i>
            <h3>Trusted Partnership</h3>
            <p>
              We build lasting relationships through integrity, transparency,
              and dependable service. Every customer, partner, and stakeholder
              can rely on us to deliver consistent quality, secure digital
              solutions, and exceptional experiences across every business we
              support.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 2 -->
          <div class="bento-card card-innovation span-2">
            <div class="bento-card-left">
              <i data-lucide="rocket"></i>
              <h3>Continue Innovation</h3>
              <p>
                Innovation is at the heart of everything we create. Powered by
                PT Megah Nex Technology, we continuously develop digital
                solutions that simplify transportation, travel, tourism, golf,
                rental services, and many other industries—making every
                interaction faster, smarter, and more convenient.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bento-card-right">
              <i data-lucide="trending-up"></i>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 3 -->
          <div class="bento-card card-global span-2">
            <i data-lucide="globe"></i>
            <h3>Connected Ecosystem</h3>
            <p>
              Megaterra brings together a diverse network of trusted businesses
              into one integrated platform. From Majestic Fast Ferry and Batam
              Centre Harbour to Batam Island Country Club, Meyer Rental, and
              many more, we create seamless connections that enhance
              accessibility and deliver greater value for customers.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 4 -->
          <div class="bento-card card-sustainable">
            <i data-lucide="leaf"></i>
            <h3>Customer-Centric Excellence</h3>
            <p>
              Our customers are at the center of every decision we make. We are
              committed to delivering reliable services, intuitive digital
              experiences, and responsive support that exceed expectations and
              create long-term trust.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="our-brand">
        <div class="section-container">
          <div class="section-header">
            <h2>Our Brand</h2>
            <p class="smaller-label">
              Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit.
              Exercitationem architecto ratione delectus provident quos repellat
              harum, ea rerum nisi neque consequuntur fuga nulla deserunt,
              distinctio non corporis quod iure voluptatem.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="brand-grid-container">
            <div class="brand-row">
              <div class="brand-card">
                <img
                  src="/images/logos/mff-logo-blue.webp"
                  alt="Majestic Fast Ferry"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="brand-card">
                <img src="/images/logos/mjs-logo.webp" alt="MJS" />
              </div>
              <div class="brand-card">
                <img src="/images/logos/plpb-logo.webp" alt="PLPB" />
              </div>
              <div class="brand-card">
                <img
                  src="/images/logos/ranoh-island-logo.webp"
                  alt="Adventure Ranoh Island"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="brand-card">
                <img
                  src="/images/logos/bcift-logo.webp"
                  alt="Batam Center Ferry Terminal"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="brand-card bigger-brand-logo">
                <img
                  src="/images/logos/majestic-kawanua-logo.webp"
                  alt="Majestic Kawanua"
                />
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="brand-row brand-row-2">
              <div class="brand-card brand-card-bicc">
                <img
                  src="/images/logos/bicc-logo.webp"
                  alt="Batam Island Country Club"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="brand-card">
                <img src="/images/logos/megacosta-logo.webp" alt="Megacosta" />
              </div>
              <div class="brand-card">
                <img
                  src="/images/logos/kaima-logo.webp"
                  alt="Kalma Hotel & Villa"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="brand-card">
                <img
                  src="/images/logos/css-logo.webp"
                  alt="PT Cahaya Samudra Shipyard"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="brand-card">
                <img
                  src="/images/logos/indomal-logo-horizontal.webp"
                  alt="Indomal Fast Ferry"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="brand-card">
                <img
                  src="/images/logos/majestic-durian-farm-logo.webp"
                  alt="Majestic Durian Farm"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="brand-card">
                <img src="/images/logos/mha-logo.webp" alt="Majestic Build" />
              </div>
              <div class="brand-card bigger-brand-logo">
                <img
                  src="/images/logos/majestic-koi-farm-logo.webp"
                  alt="Majestic Koi Farm"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="brand-card">
                <img
                  src="/images/logos/dbb-logo.webp"
                  alt="Bloom Nation Home DIY"
                />
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="brand-row brand-row-3">
              <div class="brand-card">
                <img
                  src="/images/logos/meyer-rental-logo-short.webp"
                  alt="Meyer Rental"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="brand-card">
                <img
                  src="/images/logos/meyer-motors-logo-short.webp"
                  alt="Meyer Motors"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="brand-card">
                <img
                  src="/images/logos/nusa-indah-logo.webp"
                  alt="Nusa Indah Travel"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="brand-card brand-card-nxg">
                <img src="/images/logos/nxg-logo.webp" alt="NXG" />
              </div>
              <div class="brand-card">
                <img
                  src="/images/logos/veranta-cafe-logo.webp"
                  alt="Veranta Cafe"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="brand-card bigger-brand-logo">
                <img
                  src="/images/logos/dumai-express-logo.webp"
                  alt="Dumai Express Group"
                />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('../partials/footer') %> <%-include('../partials/loginModal')%>
  </body>
</html>
